	(text_box "R_{lim}: I_{lim}\n  1130 Ω = 788 mA\n  1780 Ω = 500 mA\n  8870 Ω = 100 mA\n\nUse the formula from datasheet (or see above) for other charging currents. Maximum allowed is 1.5 A."
